      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "During an argument with his wife at their Rhode Island home, Edward Caniglia (petitioner) retrieved a handgun from the bedroom, put it on the dining room table, and asked his wife to \u201cshoot [him] now and get it over with.\u201d She declined, and instead left to spend the night at a hotel."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "2020-20-157",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "49fd95ba2b463c1501f57d762c31bb9c60902eb78fc5c79ad07c101bfa0c29a1",
      "evidence_id": "ev-49fd95ba2b46-0000-0008",
      "kind": "holding",
      "opinion_part": "majority",
      "pages": {
        "end": 6,
        "start": 6
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "The First Circuit's \u201ccommunity caretaking\u201d rule, however, goes beyond anything this Court has recognized."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Thomas",
      "case_id": "2020-20-157",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "49fd95ba2b463c1501f57d762c31bb9c60902eb78fc5c79ad07c101bfa0c29a1",
      "evidence_id": "ev-49fd95ba2b46-0000-0007",
      "kind": "stated_consequence",
      "opinion_part": "majority",
      "pages": {
        "end": 7,
        "start": 7
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "We thus vacate the judgment below and remand for further proceedings consistent with this opinion."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Alito",
      "case_id": "2020-20-157",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "49fd95ba2b463c1501f57d762c31bb9c60902eb78fc5c79ad07c101bfa0c29a1",
      "evidence_id": "ev-49fd95ba2b46-0000-0006",
      "kind": "concurrence",
      "opinion_part": "concurrence",
      "pages": {
        "end": 8,
        "start": 8
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Alito, J., concurring"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Kavanaugh",
      "case_id": "2020-20-157",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "49fd95ba2b463c1501f57d762c31bb9c60902eb78fc5c79ad07c101bfa0c29a1",
      "evidence_id": "ev-49fd95ba2b46-0001-0000",
      "kind": "concurrence",
      "opinion_part": "concurrence",
      "pages": {
        "end": 12,
        "start": 12
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "In sum, the Court properly rejects the broad \u201ccommunity caretaking\u201d theory on which the decision below was based. The Court's decision goes no further, and on that understanding, I join the opinion in full."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Kavanaugh",
      "case_id": "2020-20-157",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "49fd95ba2b463c1501f57d762c31bb9c60902eb78fc5c79ad07c101bfa0c29a1",
